---
// === PrivacySection — ZDR architecture, Rizzo sidecar, fail-closed ===
// Dati reali dai codebase Factum (rizzo_pii, ZDR policy, A1 directive).
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5 py-20 md:py-28">
  <!-- Background pattern -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-grid-subtle opacity-30" aria-hidden="true" />

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center">
      <span class="mb-4 inline-block text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-factum-400">Privacy by design</span>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-100 sm:text-3xl">
        Zero Data Retention
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
        GDPR compliant per costruzione. Non è una checklist — è l'architettura.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Cards grid -->
    <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- ZDR -->
      <div class="animate-fade-up rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-deep-800/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-white/10" style="animation-delay: 0.05s">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-factum-500/10 text-lg">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100">Zero persistenza PII</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
          Il mapping dei placeholder vive in <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">RAM</span>
          per-request e viene droppato subito dopo la risposta. Mai sul DB.
          Direttiva A1: nessun <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">result</span> LLM persistito sul job.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-lg bg-deep-900/60 p-3 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500">
          <span class="text-factum-400">$</span> RIZZO_PII_REQUIRED=true
          <br />
          <span class="text-zinc-600"># fail-closed: sidecar giù → 503</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sidecar Rizzo -->
      <div class="animate-fade-up rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-deep-800/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-white/10" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 text-lg">🧠</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100">Sidecar PII (Rizzo 0.3B)</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
          Modello leggero su CPU che pseudonimizza i dati prima dell'LLM.
          <span class="text-zinc-400">Nessun dato personale</span> raggiunge
          DeepSeek o Claude. Solo placeholder.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-600">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500" />
            Nomi → <span class="font-mono text-zinc-500">[PERSONA_001]</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500" />
            P.IVA → <span class="font-mono text-zinc-500">[PIVA_001]</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500" />
            Indirizzi → <span class="font-mono text-zinc-500">[ADDR_001]</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Fail-closed -->
      <div class="animate-fade-up rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-deep-800/30 p-6 transition-colors hover:border-white/10" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
        <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-red-500/10 text-lg">🛡️</div>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100">Fail-closed</h3>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
          Se il sidecar è giù, Factum non serve richieste. 503.
          <span class="text-zinc-400">Nessun fail-open</span> che esporrebbe
          dati in chiaro. Le immagini (nessun layer testuale) sono bloccate a 422.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-xs text-zinc-600">
          <div>Sidecar down → <span class="font-mono text-red-400">503</span></div>
          <div>Immagine → <span class="font-mono text-red-400">422</span></div>
          <div>Auth mancante → <span class="font-mono text-red-400">401</span></div>
          <div>Redis down → <span class="font-mono text-red-400">503</span> (optional)</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- factum-fic privacy note -->
    <div class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl animate-fade-up rounded-xl border border-amber-500/10 bg-amber-500/5 p-5" style="animation-delay: 0.2s">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
        <span class="mt-0.5 text-lg">📁</span>
        <div>
          <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-100">I tuoi dati non escono dal computer</h4>
          <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-zinc-500">
            Con factum-fic, i file XML FatturaPA vengono elaborati <span class="text-zinc-400">al 100% in locale</span> —
            mai trasmessi a nessuno. I PDF inviano solo il testo estratto via HTTPS,
            mai il file originale. Mai memorizzato. Le credenziali stanno nel file
            <span class="font-mono text-zinc-400">.env</span> (git-ignorato).
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>